Set Cols 80
Set Rows 20

Hide
Source common.setup.tape

# Launch with a new notebook
Type@0 "euporie notebook"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Ctrl+N
Sleep 2
# Enter code into a cell
Type@0 m
Enter
