Sleep 0.1
Ctrl+E
Sleep 0.1
Type@0 ':set-color-scheme-default'
Enter
Show
Sleep 2

Alt+S
Sleep 0.5
Down
Sleep 0.5
Down
Sleep 0.5
Right
Sleep 1
Hide
Enter

Enter
Ctrl+A
